		{
			dependencies: ["67C69988D695984B"]
			description: [
				"To train AIs in the &eAI Training Center&r, you'll need a &lCoolant&r. There are 3 types of coolant. In order of efficiency:"
				"- &6&lPCB Coolant&r, used in computation, normally requires 16,000 mB for a recipe. This is the only one you have acess to currently."
				"- &c&lFX Coolant&r, unlocked in &2UV&r. Its main components are &[cuandavis]Primordium Sigma&r, &6Phoenicium&r and &9Hydrogen&r. It normally requires 4,000 mB for a recipe."
				"- &9&lWarp Coolant&r, unlocked in &2UIV&r. Its main components are &6Broad-Omega Matter&r, &wGeneva particles&r and &*Primordium Delta&r. It normally requires 1,000 mB for a recipe."
				""
				"Later on you will need to use the better coolants for training more advanced AI's."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"There have been some reports of &9Warp coolant&r causing some problems with causality and forming time-loops, perhaps due to its negative kinetic energy. Oops"
			]
